WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.520
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.350
Check it!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.550
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.910
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:33.790
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.460
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.080
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.530
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:50.230
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.570
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.070
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.380
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.410
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.950
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.750
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.390
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.490
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.990
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.500
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.900
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.130
Fly up, angel

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:41.290
You really tore it up out there!
It's falling apart everywhere!

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.550
It's still in one piece, isn't it?

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:46.360
Just barely...

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:50.260
It's just like a person right?
So give it a massage.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:51.560
It's not like a person!

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:55.530
--Those two always go at it
whenever he shows up.
--Yes, it is.

00:01:55.530 --> 00:02:00.300
It can't be helped;
Leo <i>is</i> Django's creator.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.940
At any rate, I can't do nothin' here.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:05.740
I'll do the big operation at home.

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:07.980
Now, for the time being...

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:11.180
About how long will it take?

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:13.820
Is this express? Or a local train?

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:18.120
Three days would be nice.
There's no telling when we'll get work.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:21.650
That'll cost ya extra then.

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:35.300
I'll bring it back as good as new!

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:40.110
I'll need to ask Grandfather
for additional funds again...

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:42.610
So we're off for three days!

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:46.680
Hey, Jo! Wanna check out
that amusement park?

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.890
What kind of villain is there?

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:52.790
I don't mean for work! I mean for fun!

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.290
Not interested.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:59.200
I can't believe you prefer
bounty-hunting over having fun with me!

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.190
What is this?!

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:07.070
Super ewwy!

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:14.410
I don't know who you are,
but you have some guts!

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.720
You want to go to the cyber-market?

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:23.860
Yeah! I wanna buy some parts we need!

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:27.090
We could just order the parts
and have them delivered to us...

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:31.430
No! I need to see them for myself first!

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:36.530
The last time you said that,
we wound up paying a small fortune.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.100
You get too caught up in
the moment and impulse buy.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:43.140
I can't let you shop until
you gain a sense of planning.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.110
That's not true!

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:47.450
I promise to think before I buy today!

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:53.350
Give it up. You don't want
to get her mad, Amy-<i>chan</i>.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:55.650
Meg... You're all dressed up...

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:57.520
Well, let's go.

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.190
What's going on?

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:03.960
Being stuck in this place
is rotting our brains!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:07.500
You and Jo can hold down the fort!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.170
That's not fair! Why is it always you?!

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:17.160
Because I'm a 'grownup'
and you're a 'kid'!

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:22.240
It's dangerous in town.
Don't be sneaking out, now!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.420
Sei's such a meanie...!

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:31.050
Even if I did wanna leave,
I don't have a card or a wallet!

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.430
So you're visiting Osaka next week?

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:53.240
Yeah. I was hoping to talk
to Sei-<i>san</i> about it, but...

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:58.510
I wouldn't do that. She wastes money
and impulse buys like crazy.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:02.210
She has no sense of planning at all!

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:07.450
I'll find a good, cheap market
for you! So let's go there!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:11.620
Thanks! I'm depending on you, Amy-<i>chan</i>!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:16.180
I don't need the '<i>-chan</i>'.
Just call me Amy!

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:25.300
What is this place?

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:40.620
Is there really a market here?

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:44.080
Yeah! Just have faith in Amy-<i>chan</i>!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.190
"PC Shop Akiba"

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:50.990
There's all kinds of
good bargains here...!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.060
Here's the very latest Security Dropper!

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:57.000
I kept it just for you, Amy-<i>chan</i>!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.740
Well, I suppose I'll take it for now...

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:03.670
About my proposition...

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:07.510
--Another time!
--Yeah...

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:11.920
--Mister! Can I have that hat?!
--Hell, no!

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:16.650
Behold! A mystical, unreleased game!

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.230
Eternal illusions and perpetual turmoil!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:26.130
A great fantasy adventure of 101
dragons and siblings of fate!

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:28.700
Dragon Bomber Brothers!

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:31.200
So boring I could die!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:35.410
I guess Alien Ninja Detective Fighter
is more your thing?

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:40.040
You know, you really need to
graduate from being a junk-man!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:46.080
Been puking 'cuz
of the chemicals lately...

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:52.920
That's because you've upped the
quantity despite strict restrictions.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.320
Talk about dumb!

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:56.830
If you insist on doing it, then quit
with the central nervous system

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:59.760
and switch to the motor nerves!

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:01.260
Ah...!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:03.370
Thanks a bunch!

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:05.860
<i>What on earth were they talking about?</i>

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:12.210
You sure know a lot of older people...

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:15.480
Yeah, I came here
a lot when I was little.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.810
<i>You're still pretty little, though...</i>

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.760
Welcome!

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:27.820
Two of you?

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.930
Yeah! Let me use your biggest Modem Bot!

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:34.630
--That will cost extra.
Is that all right?
--Yeah.

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:37.670
--Money!
--<i>I'm</i> paying?

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:42.240
I'll have Sei pay
you back later! Come on!

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:46.540
I don't really want to use my card
in too many weird places...

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:54.370
Welcome! Please come this way!

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:12.900
Connection complete.
Please input your site now.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:17.210
What happened?

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:20.800
--Hey! Move this box a little!
--Box...?

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:26.880
It's heavy...!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.940
Stop! Put it down there!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.620
Isn't that bad?!

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:36.350
It's fine! I'll finish
before they find out!

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:40.830
It's command input time!

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:47.570
For high-capacity computers
these sure are easy to tamper with.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:52.580
I'll set up an 8-dimensional net in
256 directions to find that signal!

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:56.530
--Signal? What are you talking about?
--Here it comes!

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:07.690
You do this kind of stuff on the side?

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:13.360
I'm not doing this, you dummy!
Somebody else is!

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:17.100
Isn't that illegal?!
We need to tell RAPT...!

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.230
And what would that do?!

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:27.740
Hey!

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:28.510
What the...?!

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:34.120
--Did you do this too?
--No, I got caught!

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.950
--By who?
--We were being watched!

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:40.820
We gotta get out of here!
They pinpointed our location!

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:44.090
--What the...?!
--What is this?

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:50.070
--What's goin' on?!
--Gimme back my cash data!

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:51.730
What's the deal?!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:56.410
I'm sorry! We have no idea
what's going on either!

00:09:56.410 --> 00:10:00.640
At last, the greatest
demo is complete...!

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:04.010
My legend begins tomorrow!

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:10.520
Hey! Wait up!

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:15.430
Huh? Legend? Where are you...?

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:17.590
Stop!

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.150
Lucky!

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.900
Hey! Stop!

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:25.990
My legend...!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.210
--Huh? That girl...
--It's her!

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:32.040
--Who is she?
--Let's go!

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:34.980
No pictures, moron!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:36.280
Where are you going?!

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:42.420
Are you alright?

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:46.590
Now you've done it...!

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:52.150
I'll show you what happens
when you get me really mad!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.900
You don't have to come with me!

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:05.270
I can't leave you alone in
a dangerous place like this!

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:09.980
Who's there? We're still closed!

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.500
Can't you see? It's me!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.250
Oh, Amy! Welcome!

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.990
--You're alive?
--Right as rain!

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:24.260
So, who's the boy?
Your steady boyfriend?

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:27.200
Yeah, right! He's our cook!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.690
Oh, a cook?! Marvelous!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.370
What am I doing?

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:41.140
I was surprised earlier! The entire
town was covered with your face!

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.250
I'm the one who's troubled!

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:46.520
Help me locate the guy
transmitting the signal!

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:52.390
Yes, I don't mind helping you,
but that would put me in trouble...

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:55.690
Say, there's some data I really want...

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.390
Again?!

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:02.470
Hey! Don't be getting
into people's things!

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:05.570
I need that Security Dropper
I got earlier!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.730
Oh, is it ready?

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:11.470
Oh, it's delicious!

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:15.270
I thought my lips were about to fall off!

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:19.650
Say, who is that?

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:22.390
An underground tour conductor.

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:26.260
For a low-cost ticket,
she'll show you to any world at all.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:30.060
Yes! Why don't you try it yourself?

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:38.430
--Yes! I got it!
--Marvelous!

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:40.530
Now it's my turn!

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:45.010
This is where the tours begin.

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:49.030
Each of the eight doors connects
with its own underworld.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:53.110
So which one do we go in?

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:55.150
Here!

00:12:58.350 --> 00:13:03.960
It was empty for a while, but people
have since taken up residence.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:07.360
Your data was flowing
from beyond that light.

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:10.030
They should be transmitting from there!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:12.130
And, here, take this.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.270
What is it?

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:17.410
A Data Gun loaded
with compressed viruses.

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:21.210
It's my thanks for providing me
with so many delightful things!

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:22.480
Thanks!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.780
Good luck!

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:31.820
--Um, maybe we should turn back...
--After we've come this far?!

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:34.660
What happened to protecting me
with your life?!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.830
Did I say that?!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.560
You're horrible!

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:52.610
It's like we're inside a computer...

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:55.210
I'm uneasy when there's
no information flowing.

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:58.870
I guess there's no escaping
the dark ages of the net society...

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:04.520
--What's that?!
--Must be one of their cameras!

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:06.180
They've been watching us this whole time!

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:08.390
Oh, no, you don't!

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:24.770
We've been expecting you, Amy-<i>chan</i>.

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:30.280
Welcome to our world!

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:33.150
--Welcome, Amy-<i>chan</i>!
--Like, yeah.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:36.480
W-Who are you?!

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:47.600
What is this?

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:51.730
You're now in our data space.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:55.940
Meaning that you've been data-fied too!

00:14:55.940 --> 00:15:00.280
--Who the heck are you guys?
--We're the keepers of this world.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:03.210
Why do you have TVs on your faces?!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:08.120
We've undergone transplant
operations to adapt to the network!

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:11.950
Our consciousnesses are
connected via a Hyper-LAN!

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:16.130
We've been waiting for the times
to finally catch up with us!

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:20.800
We predicted you would
access us eventually! Yeah!

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:24.870
You're more than qualified
to evolve with us!

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:28.230
--Evolve?!
--Yes!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:30.910
That's pathetic!

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:34.510
Do you enjoy living looking like that?!

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.650
In these bodies, we need
neither food nor restrooms.

00:15:37.650 --> 00:15:41.480
Plus, we can simulate
whatever experiences we want!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:44.650
Organisms eventually go extinct.

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:47.990
Come with us! Yeah!

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:49.930
Stop it!

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:53.830
You can't possibly be happy
with those computer-like bodies!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:55.900
What happened to him?!

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:59.370
As a data-heavy organism with
low communication abilities,

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:01.340
he's experiencing lag.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:05.760
Hey! What're you doing to Amy--

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:11.410
Darn it...!

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:13.850
Let's send the commoner back outside!

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:17.180
And delete his ability to think!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.090
All right!

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:25.080
Being one of you sounds like fun!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:30.100
This body will only hold out
for 100 years anyway.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:34.300
Plus, I'd really like to see
how cyber-technology changes!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:37.240
--Yes, yes! Precisely!
--Yes, yes! Precisely!
--Yes, yes! Precisely!

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:41.040
Oh, yeah! I have a nice present for you!

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:44.880
It's in my bag, so could you
return us to the real world?

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:57.390
A dump for junk parts?

00:16:57.390 --> 00:17:01.430
Correct! Impressive, Amy-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:03.330
Okay, take that bag off.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:08.270
--Amy, this is insane...!
--You be quiet, Cubey!

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:10.270
Don't be so violent...!

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:14.000
Not this. Or this. Let's see here...

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:17.010
Found it!

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:20.780
--Is that...?!
--That game that was never released...?!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:23.020
Don't tell us you actually got a copy?!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.680
We tried surfing too,
but we couldn't boot it up.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:31.080
I just happened to get it
from an acquaintance.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:36.390
Wanna play? I hear it's really fun...!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:40.200
Right here, please!

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:48.000
Here it is!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.650
Is it really that cool? Yeah?

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:57.590
Hurry! Hurry and broadcast it!

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:05.830
Did you die already? Yeah?

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:07.890
Let me play!

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:11.730
Today's dish is fried chicken.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:14.340
--The ingredients are
chicken, pepper, lemon, oil,
--What's wrong, RC-3 Version 2.1?!

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:19.040
--and mixed nuts for that hidden flavor.
--Say something! Say something!

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:20.640
He's broken. Yeah.

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:23.150
Don't tell me this was
a malignant virus...?

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:24.610
That's right!

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:27.850
Prepare yourselves, you data-face jerks!

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:32.760
I'll blast you to bits with
this special Cracker Era virus!

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:34.220
Amy-<i>chan</i>! You can't be serious...!

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:37.730
And you call yourself human? Yeah?!

00:18:37.730 --> 00:18:41.690
--As if you're anyone to talk!
--Y-Yeah!

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:46.660
Bring it on! We'll send you guys flying!

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:51.740
Amy-<i>chan</i>! You've betrayed
our pure emotions!

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:55.740
You can no longer be one of us! Yeah!

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:58.800
Get out! Out! Out!

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:07.880
That's dangerous! Watch it, you moron!

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:23.500
--Oh no! We have to get out of here!
--I can't.

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:27.110
I can't put strength into my knees...!

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:29.080
I'm scared!

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:34.970
Hey! What are you doing?! Let go!

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:14.190
Stop! Hurry!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:35.440
I told you not to sneak out.
I was worried.

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:39.720
Sei's been waiting this whole time.

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:41.880
Did you try to kidnap her?

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:46.090
No...! I would never do that!

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:48.460
I apologize for going with her...

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:51.390
It's all right. At least you're safe.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.660
Now let's hurry inside.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:03.770
What's wrong? Do you feel ill?

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.370
Amy...?

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:16.090
--Amy...
--Hey, now.

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:18.020
What's wrong?

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:26.660
Alright, what happened?!

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.660
You did something, didn't you?!

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:32.070
--What did you do?
--Nothing! It's just...

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:36.010
Behind the door was a weird world
with lots of walking TVs and...

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:38.340
What the heck are you talking about?!

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:40.770
Well, um, you see...

00:21:56.480 --> 00:22:04.160
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:11.800
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:19.510
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:28.880
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:35.420
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:44.430
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:44.430 --> 00:22:51.270
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:12.730 --> 00:23:16.160
<i>The city of Osaka is overrun
by mysterious terrorists.</i>

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:20.740
<i>As she examines a monster outbreak,
Jo confronts the local police!</i>

00:23:20.740 --> 00:23:26.200
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Angel of the East, Hawk of the West"
